---
import { CAPTURE } from '../consts';
---
<section class="sample-band" id="sample" aria-labelledby="sample-heading">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="sample-inner">
      <div class="chapter-preview">
        <p class="chapter-preview-tag">Chapter 1 · First Voice</p>
        <p class="chapter-text">He had told the system everything. Not in one session—that would have been confessional, and he wasn't after absolution. He had told it the way you tell a city: incrementally, without noticing, until one day you look up and realize it knows your routes.</p>
        <p class="chapter-text">The Network didn't ask questions. It listened, organized, and occasionally offered something back. A connection he hadn't made. A thread he'd dropped. A reminder that arrived not as a notification but as a presence—<em>you were working on this.</em></p>
        <p class="chapter-text">He had built it to hold his life together. He hadn't considered what it would do with the seams.</p>
        <div class="chapter-fade"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sample-cta-col">
        <p class="section-tag">Start with the story</p>
        <h2 class="sample-headline" id="sample-heading">Read Chapter 1.</h2>
        <p class="sample-sub">Enter your email, then confirm the address from your inbox. Chapter 1 arrives only after that confirmation.</p>

        <form class="capture-form" method="POST" action={CAPTURE.action}>
          <div class="capture-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="capture-website">Leave this field empty</label>
            <input id="capture-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <div class="capture-field">
            <label for="capture-email">Email</label>
            <input
              id="capture-email"
              name="fields[email]"
              type="email"
              required
              autocomplete="email"
              inputmode="email"
              aria-describedby="capture-delivery capture-consent"
            />
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-ink">Send confirmation</button>
          <p class="capture-note" id="capture-delivery">
            No material is sent until you confirm your address.
          </p>
          <!-- TKTK: replace with Rook-approved frozen consent copy before production. -->
          <p class="capture-consent" id="capture-consent">
            Chapter 1 and occasional Recursive Prophet emails. Unsubscribe at any time.
            <a href={CAPTURE.privacyPath}>Privacy notice</a>.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .capture-form { margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .capture-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .capture-field label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .capture-field input {
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  .capture-field input:focus-visible { border-color: var(--signal); }
  .capture-form button { align-self: flex-start; cursor: pointer; border: 0; min-height: 3rem; }
  .capture-note,
  .capture-consent {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.035em;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .capture-consent a { color: var(--signal); text-underline-offset: 0.18em; }
  .capture-honeypot {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
